#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Näomudelit ei saa salvestada"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Skanni teine mudel"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Teist mudelit ei õnnestunud salvestada"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Teie esimene mudel on salvestatud, nii et näoga sisselogimine juba toimib. "
"Ruum peab ikka olema piisavalt hele, et näha teie nägu – muutke valgustust, "
"mitte ei lülita seda välja – ja proovige uuesti või jätke vahele ja lisage "
"mudel hiljem menüüst Seaded."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Teine skannimine: prillid, habe või teistsugune valgus"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Esimene mudel salvestatud: näoga sisselogimine juba töötab. Teine mudel "
"muudab tuvastamise usaldusväärsemaks, kui midagi muutub: pange ette prillid, "
"mida vahel kannate (või võtke need ära), salvestage see teistsuguse habemega "
"ja muutke valgust — lülitage lamp sisse või välja, eemalduge aknast. Hoidke "
"nägu selgelt nähtavana ja vajutage uuesti Skanni; järgneb sama lühike "
"juhendatud salvestus."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello saab teie {} automaatselt avada, kasutades näo autentimist "
"(tuvastatud rahakott: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-i olek:</b> TPM-i riistvara ja tööriistade kontrollimine..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello saab teie {} automaatselt avada, kasutades näo autentimist "
"(tuvastatud rahakott: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-i olek:</b> tuvastati TPM-i riistvara. <i>tpm2-tools</i> automaatne "
"installimine..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello saab teie {} automaatselt avada, kasutades näo autentimist "
"(tuvastatud rahakott: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-i olek:</b> riistvara TPM 2.0 aktiivne. Teie parool on TPM-is "
"turvaliselt suletud."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello saab teie {} automaatselt avada, kasutades näo autentimist "
"(tuvastatud rahakott: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-i olek:</b> TPM-i riistvara tuvastati, kuid <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automaatne installimine ebaõnnestus. Käivitage <code>sudo apt install tpm2-"
"tools</code>. Naasmine tarkvarapõhise mandaadi vahemällu."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello saab teie {} automaatselt avada, kasutades näo autentimist "
"(tuvastatud rahakott: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-i olek:</b> TPM-i riistvara ei tuvastatud. Tarkvarapõhise mandaadi "
"vahemällu (AES-256-GCM) kasutamine."

