#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Töölaua märguanne kuvatakse samal ajal, kui Ubuntu Hello otsib teie nägu ja "
"edastab seejärel tulemuse. Ebaõnnestunud katsed jäävad teavituste loendisse."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Kuva märguanded"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr "Üks kaart näo autentimise katse kohta, mida värskendatakse tulemusega."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Märguandehelid"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Esitage süsteemiheli tuvastatud või ebaõnnestunud katse korral."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Kaasake diagnostika"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Lisage igale kaardile mudel, kindlus vs läviväärtus, raamid, kaamera ja "
"ajastus. Kasulik probleemist teatamisel."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Turvalisus"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Kui täpselt peab sinu nägu kattuma ja kas Ubuntu Hello palub sul kinnitada, "
"et oled ka tegelikult kohal."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Näo sobivuse rangus"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
